.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc


# Photo intake: originals stay out of git. Only assets/photos/ (built) is committed.
# manifest.csv is the exception — it is the source of every caption, consent record
# and gallery position, and tools/photos.py render regenerates the pages from it.
# Losing it with the originals would lose all of that. It carries no image data.
_incoming/*
!_incoming/manifest.csv
Village_Image/
tools/realesrgan/

# YouTube channel art: drafts and exports for the channel itself, not site assets.
# Nothing on the site links to them, so they would only bloat the repo and get
# served from maatirakatha.com for no reason. Same rule as Village_Image/.
youtube_assets/
youtube-banner.jpg
youtube-logo.png

